Which of the following matrices are lower triangular matrices?

$$
A=\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 0 \\ 0 & -5\end{bmatrix}
$$

$$
B=\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 & 0 & 0 \\ 0 & -11 & 0 & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & 7 & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -8\end{bmatrix}
$$

$$
C=\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\ 0 & -7 & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & 7\end{bmatrix}
$$

